h-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb5AronszajnTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb5AronszajnTree}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb5\\text{-}aronszajn\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb5AronszajnTree}_S(T,R,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Aronszajn}_\\kappa(\\langle T,R\\rangle)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb5\\text{-}aronszajn\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb5AronszajnTree}_S(T,R,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Aronszajn}_\\kappa(\\langle T,R\\rangle)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This compatibility predicate reuses the canonical Aronszajn-tree definition instead of duplicating its level and branch clauses.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-aronszajn","status":"resolved","id":"ecfb8f49ad1dc1fc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-aronszajn]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-aronszajn","status":"resolved","id":"ecfb8f49ad1dc1fc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Aronszajn}_\\kappa$ (Aronszajn-tree predicate; see [[58-df-aronszajn]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\langle T,R\\rangle\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Aronszajn}_\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Aronszajn}_\\kappa","display":false},{"tex"